{
  "job_B15.8.608_20260920_210345": {
    "text": "\u00deis syndan \u00fe\u00e6s wudes gemeara in to Readanoran, i pirit.\nAndlang englungadene eal swa w\u00e6terwile yruan innan \u00fe\u00e6ne h\u00e6\u00feenan byrgels.\nOf \u00fean h\u00e6\u00f0enan byrgels be wyrtwalan innan baruot s\u00e6d.\nAnd of barfot s\u00e6de innan timbers\u00e6d, & of timbers\u00e6de innan steapan cnolles scyd.\nAnd of steapan cnolles scydde on hansl\u00e6des h\u00e6fdan, & of hansl\u00e6des heafdan innan grenan weg.\nAnd of \u00feam grenan wege innan heald\u00e6 m\u00e6res hling, & of \u00feam hlince innan stanoranlege.\nAnd of stanoran lege innan stanmeres hling, & of stanmeres hlince on cadendtes heafdan.\nAnd of cadenes heafdan on holemeres hling, & of holemeres hling innan stanbeorh.\nAnd of stan beorhge innan \u00fe\u00e6ne smalan \u00e6rc, of \u00feon smalan \u00e6rc sce innan \u00feone mapeldre on west halfe\nOf \u00fean mapeldre ine es wyrte pitte innan dragemeres hling.\nAnd of dragemeres hlince innan ruganwic, & of ruganwic innan depan hauisteal on hremryrc.\nAnd of hremhrycce on \u00feere fulan slostendan mapeldere ofer innan sigerdene.\nAnd of sigerdene innan badandene on clacces wadland, & of clacces wadlande into lufemere,",
